NAME

netcfg - Configure network state

SYNOPSIS

    netcfg <command>
    netcfg renew
    netcfg automatic [<interface>]
    netcfg manual [<interface>] <address/prefix> <gateway> <dns>
    netcfg enable <interface>
    netcfg disable <interface>
    netcfg reload

DESCRIPTION

Configure network state.

OPTIONS

    -h, --help — Show this help.

